      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A silicide coating can protect a refractory high-entropy alloy from high-temperature oxidation.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thermal treatments can induce compact Al2O3 or Cr2O3 protective layers.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::chunk::000::abstract::e30693f104"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxygen diffusion accelerates degradation at high temperature.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense and adherent oxide scale limits oxygen diffusion into the metal substrate.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::chunk::000::abstract::e30693f104",
        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Thin, continuous Al2O3, Cr2O3, or silicide-derived oxide layers are examples of the proposed protective barrier.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
