        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The machine-learning framework uses oxide-scale composition, thickness, porosity, and oxygen diffusivity as predictive inputs.",
